#: xblock/static/js/src/studio/oa_edit_listeners.js:152
msgid ""
"You have deleted an option. That option has been removed from its criterion "
"in the sample responses in the Learner Training step. You might have to "
"select a new option for the criterion."
msgstr ""
"Umefuta chaguo. Chaguo hilo limeondolewa kwenye kigezo chake katika majibu "
"mfano katika hatua ya Mafunzo ya Wanafunzi. Labda utahitaji kuchagua chaguo "
"jipya kwa kigezo hicho."

